@McpJiraConflu_HostAddress = https://localhost:7089
@apiToken =

### Health (без авторизации)
GET {{McpJiraConflu_HostAddress}}/health

### MCP initialize (нужен API-токен Bearer)
POST {{McpJiraConflu_HostAddress}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2024-11-05",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": {
      "name": "http-client",
      "version": "1.0"
    }
  }
}

### MCP tools/list
POST {{McpJiraConflu_HostAddress}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "tools/list"
}
